Components of a search engine
    we will build a tiny search engine
    web crawler
        starts at one url and navigates to all urls on that website
        reads a website, then fetch a website remotely
        extract all important information
    search index
        uses crawler information
        organizes it in an easy fast manner
        build a search algorithm
        rank results
    store search index
        prevents repetitive crawls

Command line work
    ls - listing files and folders in current dir
    pwd - present working dir
    mkdir - make dir
    ls -l - ls + attributes, size, permission
    man - manual
    cd - change dir
    touch - make a new file
    cat - shows contents of file
    vim - view in machine (text editor)
    :wq - write file then quit

node.js
    sudo apt install nodejs
    currently installed on my vs code
